{'symbol': 'ZBH', 'date': '2022-02-23 18:25:00', 'title': 'ZIMVIE TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ZIMVIE INC. (NASD:ZIMV) WILL REPLACE TABULA RASA HEALTHCARE INC. (NASD:TRHC) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, MARCH 2. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT ZIMMER BIOMET HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: ZBH) IS SPINNING OFF ZIMVIE IN A TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON MARCH 1.'}